OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigate concert knife
OL,4,Aattack after man suffers facial injury
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating after a man
OL,7,Fsuffered a facial injury in an alleged
OL,8,Fknife attack at a high-profile dance
OL,9,Fmusic concert in Custom House Square,
OL,10,FBelfast.
OL,12,FThe incident, which took place at a
OL,13,Fshow headlined by popular DJ Bryan
OL,14,FKearney, resulted in a man in his 30s
OL,15,Frequiring hospital treatment for a
OL,16,Flarge cut below his eye.
OL,18,FPolice said the injured man was
OL,19,Fsurrounded by a group of males, when a
OL,20,Fstruggle ensued and he was attacked
OL,21,Fwith what he believed to have been a
OL,22,Fknife.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
