OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigate concert knife
OL,4,Aattack after man suffers facial injury
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe attacker is described as being in
OL,7,Fhis 20s, around 5'7" tall, with fair
OL,8,Fhair and was wearing a grey tracksuit.
